  "id": "worklife-balance",
  "term": "work–life balance",
  "definition": "Work–life balance is a person’s ability to manage and combine work responsibilities with personal life so that neither regularly crowds out the other. It describes a changing state in which job demands and personal needs stay in reasonable balance without undue harm to time, relationships, or well-being.",
